notes.content:
[b][Update][/b]
~After entering the corresponding chapter from the chapter selection, the notebook only retains the evidence available for the current chapter, without affecting the storyline;

[b][Fix]:[/b]
~Fixed the bug where evidence in the presentation system was not displayed (if a player saved at the presentation, reading the save would roll back the storyline a bit);
~Fixed the bug where some evidence in the notebook was not displayed;
~Fixed some text errors;
